data: {"id": "c1cf2e8076ef4b8f-thinking-parallel_evidence-249", "run_id": "c1cf2e8076ef4b8f", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "我将采集该 Pod 的完整证据链，以判断其当前异常状态和 CrashLoopBackOff 的直接原因。\n\n**首轮采集计划：**\n1. `kubectl get yaml` - 获取 Pod 完整 YAML（含 restartCount 和 containerStatuses）\n2. `kubectl_previous_logs_all_containers` - 获取崩溃前最后一个周期的容器日志（tail=100）\n3. `kubectl_events` - 确认 BackOff 事件细节\n4. `kubectl_describe` - 确认当前状态和 RestartCount\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789071788146, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

